			"notes": "### Version 1.1.0 - Initial Release\n\nWelcome to the first official release of Time Crafting Table!\n\n**✨ Features:**\n- Replaces vanilla crafting with a time-based, background crafting system.\n- Introduces the **Advanced Workbench**, which automatically replaces vanilla Crafting Tables and Crafters in Survival mode.\n- **Four tiers of Speed Upgrades** to drastically reduce crafting time.\n- **Four tiers of Range Upgrades** to keep your workbench running from a distance.\n- A powerful and highly **configurable** recipe time calculation algorithm.\n- Full compatibility with **JEI** and **EMI** for easy recipe transfer.\n- Admin-friendly commands: `/tct clearcache` and `/tct calculate <item>`.\n- Beautiful, high-resolution icons for all new items.\n- Full localization for English and Russian."
		},
